# The user-level .gitignore has bare `ios`/`android` patterns (they match any
# directory with that name, including this monorepo's generated native dirs).
# The local ruby-text Expo module keeps its native sources in ios/ and
# android/ and must stay under version control — re-include them here.
!modules/ruby-text/ios/
!modules/ruby-text/android/

